SUMMARY:Ag-gag Poster Jam - by Wishbone Animal Rights Lab
LOCATION:600 Bay Street
DESCRIPTION:More info:
  https://www.facebook.com/events/1115433054977247\n\nHosted by Wishbone
  Animal Rights Lab (https://wishbonearlab.ca/)\n\nPurpose-driven workshop
  where truth is turned into impact. At this interactive session\, with the
  assistance of Mercy For Animals\, lesser-known facts will be explored
  about ag-gag laws and animal agriculture in Canada\, from hidden industry
  practices to policies most people don’t even know exist. Then\, that
  knowledge will be put into action.
END:VEVENT
